'''Note on biome distribution:''' the catalog names the assets but not which biome they spawn in. Exact biome-to-ore mapping should be verified in-game and added to individual ore pages. A common survival-game pattern (unconfirmed for the current build): most ores are gated to specific biomes, so building near a biome border gives access to more variety.

== Perks ==

The Survive tree includes a mining-damage factor:

* <code>_minerDmg_Factor</code> on <code>Char_Skills</code> (see [[Miner]]): increases mining damage per swing (faster ore extraction)

See [[Perks]] for the full factor catalog.

== Tunneling ==

Since terrain is destructible and persistent, you can dig full underground bases:

* Long horizontal tunnels can serve as base corridors.
* Tunnels count as sheltered against overhead threats and rain.

Practical notes:

* '''Cave-ins are not simulated.''' Dig freely.
* '''Water intrusion is not simulated.''' Dig below sea level without flood risk.

